This testdef is used in tests that couple MPAS-Ocean with MALI and import
MALI's ice-shelf geometry into the ocean. It includes ocn_glcshelf and adds
    config_glc_ice_shelf_coupling_import_geometry = .true.
It sets GLC2OCN_SHELF_MASK=ungrounded and pins the MALI initial condition
(MALI_IC_FILE) to the file the ocean initial condition was built from, so
the imported geometry matches the ocean initial condition even if MALI's
default initial condition changes.

It also pins MALI's ice and ocean densities (config_ice_density = 910.0,
config_ocean_density = 1028.0) to the values that MALI initial condition and
the ocean initial condition were built with, so MALI's floatation and
lithostatic pressure match the ocean initial condition even if MALI's
defaults change.
